# Swagger / OpenAPI

When generating or changing controllers, routes, DTOs, or response models, also generate/update Swagger decorators.

Controllers must include:

- `@ApiTags('<domain>')`
- `@ApiOperation(...)` for each route
- `@ApiResponse(...)` / `@ApiCreatedResponse(...)` / `@ApiNoContentResponse(...)`
- `@ApiParam(...)` for route params
- `@ApiQuery(...)` for query params when used
- `@ApiBody(...)` when body shape is not obvious from DTO

DTO fields must include `@ApiProperty(...)` or `@ApiPropertyOptional(...)`.

Swagger docs must stay in sync with actual routes, DTO validation, params, query, status codes, and response shape.
